{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Every big plant begins as something very small — a tiny seed.","words":[[0,0.37],[0.43,0.63],[0.72,1.04],[1.1,1.51],[1.57,1.68],[1.75,2.19],[2.26,2.53],[2.61,3.08],[3.25,3.3],[3.59,3.66],[3.76,4.14],[4.24,5.06]]},{"text":"Seeds wait quietly in the soil until they get water and warmth.","words":[[0,0.48],[0.55,0.81],[0.91,1.45],[1.51,1.6],[1.65,1.72],[1.8,2.19],[2.28,2.55],[2.61,2.75],[2.81,3],[3.09,3.55],[3.63,3.79],[3.89,4.83]]},{"text":"When a seed gets water, it begins to open and wake up.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.34,0.36],[0.46,0.79],[0.86,1.11],[1.2,1.66],[1.71,1.82],[1.89,2.26],[2.31,2.38],[2.47,2.83],[2.9,3.02],[3.1,3.44],[3.5,4.09]]},{"text":"The first part to grow is a tiny root that pushes down into the soil.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.31,0.65],[0.72,1.02],[1.07,1.14],[1.21,1.46],[1.54,1.66],[1.72,1.76],[1.85,2.24],[2.31,2.58],[2.63,2.81],[2.89,3.31],[3.39,3.71],[3.8,4.02],[4.09,4.18],[4.26,5.11]]},{"text":"Roots help the plant drink water and stay steady in the ground.","words":[[0,0.42],[0.5,0.78],[0.85,0.92],[0.99,1.32],[1.37,1.65],[1.73,2.13],[2.21,2.37],[2.44,2.71],[2.77,3.16],[3.22,3.31],[3.35,3.42],[3.48,4.37]]},{"text":"Next, a small green sprout pushes up toward the sunlight.","words":[[0,0.48],[0.52,0.59],[0.69,1.04],[1.11,1.39],[1.45,1.97],[2.06,2.44],[2.51,2.65],[2.71,3],[3.04,3.11],[3.17,4.13]]},{"text":"Plants use sunlight to make their own food. This helps them grow bigger.","words":[[0,0.46],[0.55,0.74],[0.8,1.39],[1.44,1.49],[1.56,1.75],[1.78,1.97],[2.06,2.29],[2.39,2.91],[3.3,3.53],[3.61,3.95],[3.99,4.16],[4.25,4.54],[4.64,5.48]]},{"text":"As the plant grows, it makes stems and leaves.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.24,0.31],[0.38,0.76],[0.82,1.29],[1.33,1.46],[1.54,1.81],[1.86,2.32],[2.38,2.54],[2.65,3.44]]},{"text":"Some plants grow flowers, fruits, or vegetables.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.31,0.69],[0.74,0.99],[1.08,1.8],[1.94,2.4],[2.46,2.66],[2.8,3.9]]},{"text":"From a tiny seed to a tall plant, growing takes time, water, and sunshine.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.35,0.37],[0.45,0.84],[0.92,1.16],[1.21,1.3],[1.39,1.42],[1.5,1.83],[1.93,2.54],[2.83,3.25],[3.32,3.65],[3.73,4.3],[4.47,4.93],[4.96,5.12],[5.2,6.32]]}]}